{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":14,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"To the chief Musician, A Psalm of David.","tok":[{"t":"To the chief "},{"t":"Musician","s":["H5329"],"a":[0]},{"t":", A Psalm of "},{"t":"David","s":["H1732"],"a":[1]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":1,"text":"The fool hath said in his heart, There is no God. They are corrupt, they have done abominable works, there is none that doeth good.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"fool","s":["H5036"],"a":[1]},{"t":" hath "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":" in his "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[2]},{"t":", There is no "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[4]},{"t":". They are "},{"t":"corrupt","s":["H7843"],"a":[5]},{"t":", they have done "},{"t":"abominable","s":["H8581"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"works","s":["H5949"],"a":[7]},{"t":", there is none that "},{"t":"doeth","s":["H6213"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"good","s":["H2896"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"The LORD looked down from heaven upon the children of men, to see if there were any that did understand, and seek God.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"],"a":[0]},{"t":" looked "},{"t":"down","s":["H8259"],"a":[2]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"heaven","s":["H8064"],"a":[1]},{"t":" upon the "},{"t":"children","s":["H1121"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"men","s":["H0120"],"a":[5]},{"t":", to "},{"t":"see","s":["H7200"],"a":[6]},{"t":" if "},{"t":"there","s":["H3426"],"a":[7]},{"t":" were any that did "},{"t":"understand","s":["H7919"],"a":[8]},{"t":", and "},{"t":"seek","s":["H1875"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"They are all gone aside, they are all together become filthy: there is none that doeth good, no, not one.","tok":[{"t":"They are all gone "},{"t":"aside","s":["H5493"],"a":[1]},{"t":", they are all "},{"t":"together","s":["H3162"],"a":[2]},{"t":" become "},{"t":"filthy","s":["H0444"],"a":[3]},{"t":": there is none that "},{"t":"doeth","s":["H6213"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"good","s":["H2896"],"a":[6]},{"t":", no, not "}